[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16090.309, "timestamp": "04:28:10", "text": "死的。再见。结冰。这条流是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16093.71, "timestamp": "04:28:13", "text": "我一边说话一边死去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16102.55, "timestamp": "04:28:22", "text": "上帝。但是，嘿，我正路过呢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16105.83, "timestamp": "04:28:25", "text": "海浪涌入的海岸"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16106.91, "timestamp": "04:28:26", "text": "没收到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16109.67, "timestamp": "04:28:29", "text": "湿的。哎呀，我真不该说错话。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16111.91, "timestamp": "04:28:31", "text": "天哪，那边要来一波巨浪了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16114.149, "timestamp": "04:28:34", "text": "不该说不吉利的话。是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16116.189, "timestamp": "04:28:36", "text": "没打中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16120.07, "timestamp": "04:28:40", "text": "我。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16128.63, "timestamp": "04:28:48", "text": "呃，再分享一下，我忘了。我们走吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16132.51, "timestamp": "04:28:52", "text": "因为我忘了，所以就不继续这个话题了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16135.03, "timestamp": "04:28:55", "text": "是的。那么现在的计划是什么？等待，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16136.55, "timestamp": "04:28:56", "text": "那是椰子吗？等等，不对，那不是"}]